, "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "passthrough", "label": "passthrough", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "passthrough"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "Textbox", "title": "style（曲风）", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [464.71417236328125, 172.35513305664062], "pos": [-104.52738189697266, -291.22259521484375], "id": 37, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Textbox"}, "order": 6}, {"outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [61, 62], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["[Intro]\n(Gentle grand piano and soft strings fade in slowly)\n\n[Verse 1]\n阳光下的泡沫，是彩色的。\n就像被骗的我，是幸福的。\n追究什么对错？你的谎言，基于你还爱我。\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n美丽的泡沫，虽然一刹花火。\n你所有承诺，虽然都太脆弱。\n但爱像泡沫，如果能够看破，有什么难过？\n\n[Chorus]\n早该知道泡沫，一触就破。\n就像已伤的心，不胜折磨。\n也不是谁的错，谎言再多，基于你还爱我。\n\n[Verse 2]\n再美的花朵，盛开过就凋落。\n再亮眼的星，一闪过就坠落。\n爱本是泡沫，如果能够看破，有什么难过？\n\n[Bridge]\n(Strings swell, emotional vocal build-up)\n为什么难过？有什么难过？为什么难过？\n全都是泡沫，只一刹的花火。\n你所有承诺，全部都太脆弱。\n而你的轮廓，怪我没有看破，才如此难过。\n\n[Chorus]\n相爱的把握，要如何再搜索？\n相拥着寂寞，难道就不寂寞？\n爱本是泡沫，怪我没有看破，才如此难过。\n\n[Outro]\n(Piano slows down, soft vocal ad-libs)\n在雨下的泡沫，一触就破。\n当初炽热的心，早已沉没。\n说什么你爱我，如果骗我，我宁愿你沉默。\n(Fade out with gentle piano and strings)"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "passthrough", "label": "passthrough", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "passthrough"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "Textbox", "title": "lyrics（歌词）", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [484.5353088378906, 323.479248046875], "pos": [-113.17997741699219, -68.75741577148438], "id": 39, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Textbox"}, "order": 7}, {"outputs": [{"name": "AUDIO_ENCODER", "links": [25], "label": "AUDIO_ENCODER", "type": "AUDIO_ENCODER", "localized_name": "AUDIO_ENCODER"}], "color": "#432", "widgets_va